      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "sourceText": "Because the vast majority of Rust projects use\nCargo,the rest of this book assumes that you're\nusing Cargo too.Cargo comes installed with Rust\nif you used the official installers discussed in the\n\"Installation\"section.If you installed Rust through\nSome other means,check whether Cargo is",
